{"seq":3,"slug":"exception-quality-dashboard","title":"例外处理质量看板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/exception-governance/exception-quality-dashboard","wordCount":1846,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"例外处理质量看板\">例外处理质量看板</h1><p>前面三章产出的所有数据——分类标签、置信分、工单时长、证据链、核销原因码、账龄快照、渠道缺陷单——最终要在一个地方被同时看见。看板的价值不在于&quot;有个界面&quot;，而在于<strong>它决定了团队每天关注什么</strong>。一块只显示&quot;本期工单数 3,142&quot;的看板会让团队追数量；一块显示&quot;自动消化率 71%、90+ 滞留 1,390 笔、某渠道缺陷单已超期 12 天&quot;的看板会让团队追结构性问题。看板设计因此是一次指标选择，而指标选择就是管理注意力的分配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-看板的三层结构\">核心概念：看板的三层结构</h2><p>一块可用的质量看板按&quot;回答什么层级的问题&quot;分三层，混在一起会变成一堆没有主次的数字：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;L1 结论层&lt;br/&gt;这个体系健康吗&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;自动匹配率 / 例外率 / 一次做对率&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;L2 过程层&lt;br/&gt;瓶颈在哪一环&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;工单:SLA 达成率 / 在办 / 平均时长&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;挂账:账龄分布 / 清收速度 / 计提余额&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; F[&quot;渠道:缺陷单状态 / 异常渠道数&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; G[&quot;L3 下钻层&lt;br/&gt;具体是谁的问题&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;工单 → 证据 → 核销决策&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; I[&quot;渠道 → 差异类型 → 机制&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"L1 结论层&lt;br/&gt;这个体系健康吗\"] --&gt; B[\"自动匹配率 / 例外率 / 一次做对率\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"L2 过程层&lt;br/&gt;瓶颈在哪一环\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"工单:SLA 达成率 / 在办 / 平均时长\"]\n  C --&gt; E[\"挂账:账龄分布 / 清收速度 / 计提余额\"]\n  C --&gt; F[\"渠道:缺陷单状态 / 异常渠道数\"]\n  B --&gt; G[\"L3 下钻层&lt;br/&gt;具体是谁的问题\"]\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[\"工单 → 证据 → 核销决策\"]\n  G --&gt; I[\"渠道 → 差异类型 → 机制\"]</pre><p>关键约定：<strong>L1 只放能反映体系健康的比率，不放绝对量</strong>。绝对量（本期处理 3,142 张）放在 L2 的过程层作为容量参考。把绝对量放 L1 会导致团队在交易量增长时误判自己变差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指标定义的一致性与口径锁定\">指标定义的一致性与口径锁定</h2><h3 id=\"同一个指标在不同系统里必须同义\">同一个指标在不同系统里必须同义</h3><p>看板最常见的失败不是指标选错，而是<strong>同一个指标在报表、看板、周报里口径不同</strong>，导致每次会议先花 20 分钟争论数字。解法是把每个指标的定义写成可执行的 SQL 并锁定，而不是写成人能理解的描述。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>口径锁定要点</th>\n<th>易漂移点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自动匹配率</td>\n<td>分母含所有应匹配记录，含被排除的记录</td>\n<td>新增渠道时忘记纳入分母</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>例外率</td>\n<td>分母为对账记录数，非交易笔数</td>\n<td>不同团队用不同分母</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SLA 达成率</td>\n<td>分母为&quot;目标时刻已到达的工单&quot;</td>\n<td>用&quot;已关闭工单&quot;做分母会系统性高估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次做对率</td>\n<td>分母为已关闭工单；重开仅计我方原因</td>\n<td>把渠道回函重开也算失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均挂账时长</td>\n<td>加权口径：金额加权 vs 笔数加权</td>\n<td>两者结论可能相反</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;新增渠道时忘记纳入分母&quot;这一项值得单独强调：它是这类系统最隐蔽的数据缺陷。新增一个渠道时，例外数据会自动流入（因为写入路径统一），但分母数据可能来自另一条路径而未被更新，于是该渠道的例外率会被算成一个虚高的值。解决办法是<strong>分母表也由渠道清单驱动</strong>，而不是各报表各自维护渠道列表。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW v_recon_quality_daily AS&#10;WITH base AS (&#10;  SELECT d.stat_date, d.channel_code,&#10;         d.total_records,&#10;         d.matched_records,&#10;         d.exception_count,&#10;         d.auto_absorbed_count,&#10;         d.transit_self_healed_count&#10;  FROM recon_daily_stat d&#10;  JOIN channel_registry r&#10;    ON r.channel_code = d.channel_code&#10;   AND d.stat_date &gt;= r.active_from&#10;),&#10;sla AS (&#10;  SELECT date_trunc(&#39;day&#39;, s.target_at)::date AS stat_date,&#10;         c.channel_code,&#10;         count(*) AS reached,&#10;         count(*) FILTER (WHERE s.closed_at &lt;= s.target_at + s.paused_total) AS on_time&#10;  FROM case_sla_state s&#10;  JOIN recon_case c ON c.case_id = s.case_id&#10;  WHERE s.target_at &lt; now()&#10;  GROUP BY 1,2&#10;)&#10;SELECT b.stat_date, b.channel_code,&#10;       round(100.0 * b.matched_records / nullif(b.total_records, 0), 2)   AS auto_match_pct,&#10;       round(100.0 * b.exception_count  / nullif(b.total_records, 0), 4)   AS exception_rate,&#10;       round(100.0 * b.auto_absorbed_count / nullif(b.exception_count, 0), 2) AS auto_absorb_pct,&#10;       round(100.0 * b.transit_self_healed_count / nullif(b.exception_count, 0), 2) AS transit_heal_pct,&#10;       s.reached, s.on_time,&#10;       round(100.0 * s.on_time / nullif(s.reached, 0), 2)                 AS sla_on_time_pct&#10;FROM base b&#10;LEFT JOIN sla s ON s.stat_date = b.stat_date AND s.channel_code = b.channel_code;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> v_recon_quality_daily</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stat_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channel_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">total_records</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">matched_records</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exception_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto_absorbed_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">transit_self_healed_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recon_daily_stat d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel_registry r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channel_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channel_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stat_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">active_from</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sla </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'day'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stat_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channel_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reached,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">closed_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">paused_total</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> on_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_sla_state s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recon_case c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">case_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">case_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">target_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stat_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channel_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">matched_records</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">total_records</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auto_match_pct,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exception_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">total_records</span><span style=\