lor:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">transit_self_healed_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exception_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transit_heal_pct,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reached</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on_time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on_time</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reached</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sla_on_time_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sla s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stat_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stat_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channel_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channel_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段视图里 <code>JOIN channel_registry ... AND d.stat_date &gt;= r.active_from</code> 是防&quot;新增渠道污染分母&quot;的具体手段：渠道生效日之前的日期不参与计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"例外漏斗与瓶颈定位\">例外漏斗与瓶颈定位</h2><h3 id=\"漏斗的每一段都要有转化率\">漏斗的每一段都要有转化率</h3><p>看板最有用的一个视图是把例外从产生到关闭画成漏斗，每一段标出转化率。它让&quot;瓶颈在哪&quot;变成一眼可见：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>漏斗段</th>\n<th>计数</th>\n<th>转化率</th>\n<th>健康区间（经验）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不平记录</td>\n<td>48,200</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动匹配解决</td>\n<td>46,120</td>\n<td>95.7%</td>\n<td>&gt; 93%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容差/在途消化</td>\n<td>1,392</td>\n<td>66.9%（占剩余）</td>\n<td>&gt; 60%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生成工单</td>\n<td>688</td>\n<td>33.1%（占剩余）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按时结论</td>\n<td>601</td>\n<td>87.4%</td>\n<td>&gt; 85%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核销关闭</td>\n<td>574</td>\n<td>95.5%</td>\n<td>&gt; 92%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超期滞留</td>\n<td>114</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>&lt; 5%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>任何一段显著低于健康区间都指向具体章节的修复动作：第二段低说明容差或观察窗没标定好（<a href=\"../exception-classify-match/exception-rule-threshold\">例外规则与容差阈值</a>）；第五段低说明技能或容量不足（<a href=\"../case-investigation-sla/exception-case-assign\">例外工单分派与路由</a>）；第七段高说明有系统性原因导致无法在时限内查清（<a href=\"exception-trend-rootcause\">差异趋势与根因分析</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"在办量与到达率的动态平衡\">在办量与到达率的动态平衡</h3><p>静态漏斗看不见&quot;正在恶化&quot;。必须同时展示在办量（WIP）与到达率的关系，用小定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span> 做交叉校验——在办量、到达率、停留时间三者满足恒等关系，不需要分布假设（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Little%27s_law\">Little&#39;s law</a>）。如果观测到在办量上升而停留时间没变，那必然是到达率上升；如果停留时间上升而在办量不变，则是处理速率下降。两者对应的管理动作完全不同，而单看一个数字分不清。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;panel&quot;: &quot;case_wip_balance&quot;,&#10;  &quot;series&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;wip_cases&quot;,&#10;      &quot;query&quot;: &quot;SELECT date_trunc(&#39;day&#39;, now())::date, count(*) FROM recon_case WHERE state IN (&#39;assigned&#39;,&#39;investigating&#39;,&#39;escalated&#39;)&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;arrival_rate_per_day&quot;,&#10;      &quot;query&quot;: &quot;SELECT date_trunc(&#39;day&#39;, created_at)::date, count(*) FROM recon_case WHERE created_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;30 days&#39; GROUP BY 1&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;avg_residence_hours&quot;,&#10;      &quot;query&quot;: &quot;SELECT date_trunc(&#39;day&#39;, closed_at)::date, avg(extract(epoch FROM closed_at - created_at))/3600 FROM recon_case WHERE closed_at IS NOT NULL GROUP BY 1&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;alert&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;expr&quot;: &quot;wip_cases &gt; arrival_rate_per_day * 6&quot;,&#10;    &quot;level&quot;: &quot;warn&quot;,&#10;    &quot;message&quot;: &quot;在办量超过 6 天到达量，检查容量或流程阻塞&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"panel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"case_wip_balance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"series\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"wip_cases\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SELECT date_trunc('day', now())::date, count(*) FROM recon_case WHERE state IN ('assigned','investigating','escalated')\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"arrival_rate_per_day\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SELECT date_trunc('day', created_at)::date, count(*) FROM recon_case WHERE created_at >= now() - interval '30 days' GROUP BY 1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"avg_residence_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SELECT date_trunc('day', closed_at)::date, avg(extract(epoch FROM closed_at - created_at))/3600 FROM recon_case WHERE closed_at IS NOT NULL GROUP BY 1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"alert\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"expr\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"wip_cases > arrival_rate_per_day * 6\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"warn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"在办量超过 6 天到达量，检查容量或流程阻塞\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>告警表达式用&quot;在办量 vs 到达率的倍数&quot;而不是绝对阈值，因为绝对阈值会随业务规模漂移——业务量翻倍时，同一份在办量从&quot;积压&quot;变成&quot;正常&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"看板的可审计性与口径争议的解决\">看板的可审计性与口径争议的解决</h2><h3 id=\"每个数字可下钻到明细\">每个数字可下钻到明细</h3><p>看板上的任何数字必须能下钻到构成它的明细，且明细必须是<strong>当时的口径</strong>。这一条在遇到口径争议时是唯一有效的解决手段：与其争论&quot;这个 71% 是怎么算的&quot;，不如点开看到具体哪 487 张工单被算作自动消化。</p>\n<p>这要求看板不是&quot;把聚合数写进一张表&quot;，而是<strong>聚合数可从明细重算</strong>。实现上聚合表是缓存，明细是真相源：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE dashboard_metric (&#10;  metric_key     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  scope_type     TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (scope_type IN (&#39;global&#39;,&#39;channel&#39;,&#39;diff_type&#39;,&#39;queue&#39;)),&#10;  scope_value    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  stat_date      DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  value          NUMERIC(20,6) NOT NULL,&#10;  definition_ver TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  computed_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (metric_key, scope_type, scope_value, stat_date)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE metric_definition (&#10;  metric_key     TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  definition_ver TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  sql_text       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  owner          TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_from DATE NOT NULL&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dashboard_metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  metric_key     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope_type     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (scope_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'global'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'channel'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'diff_type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'queue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope_value    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stat_date      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  definition_ver </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  computed_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (metric_key, scope_type, scope_value, stat_date)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> metric_definition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  metric_key     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  definition_ver </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sql_text       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  owner</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>definition_ver</code> + <code>metric_definition</code> 的组合解决了一个长期痛点：当口径修订后，历史数据仍然标注着旧口径，看板可以显示&quot;9 月 20 日前为 v1 口径，之后为 v2&quot;，而不是让修订把历史抹平成无法解释的新数字。这与 <a href=\"../suspense-writeoff/writeoff-approval-control\">核销审批与权限</a> 里&quot;审批矩阵在决策创建时冻结&quot;是同一类做法：<strong>口径与规则必须版本化，不能原地覆盖</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"跨系统对账式的自检\">跨系统对账式的自检</h3><p>看板自身也需要被校验。三类自检应当定期跑：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>自检</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>发现什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>恒等式校验</td>\n<td>自动匹配 + 例外消化 + 生成工单 = 不平记录总数</td>\n<td>分类遗漏或重复计数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小定律校验</td>\n<td>在办量 ≈ 到达率 × 停留时间</td>\n<td>状态流转漏记（工单未正确关闭）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账务一致性</td>\n<td>挂账余额 = 挂账分录累计 − 核销累计</td>\n<td>分录写入失败或幂等失效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三类自检直接连回账务，是最有价值的一条——它把&quot;看板上的数字&quot;与&quot;账上的钱&quot;绑定起来。如果挂账余额与分录累计不符，说明要么有分录没写成，要么幂等键设计有漏洞导致了重复或缺失。这类问题在月末结账时才被发现代价极高，日常自检能在当天暴露。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>看板分三层：L1 只放比率（体系健康），L2 放过程瓶颈，L3 可下钻到明细；绝对量不属于 L1。</li>\n<li>每个指标的口径要锁成可执行 SQL 并版本化（<code>definition_ver</code> + <code>metric_definition</code>），否则每次会议先争论数字。</li>\n<li>漏斗每段都要算转化率并给健康区间，任何一段偏低都直接指向某章的具体修复动作。</li>\n<li>用漏斗看结构、用在办量与到达率的倍数看趋势，绝对阈值会随业务规模漂移而失效。</li>\n<li>看板自身要跑三类自检：恒等式、Little 定律、账务一致性；第三类把看板与账上的钱绑定，是最高价值的一条。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>看板暴露的问题会回到 <a href=\"exception-trend-rootcause\">差异趋势与根因分析</a> 做归因，进而进入 <a href=\"high-risk-channel-govern\">高发渠道治理</a> 的专项——本 hub 的四条主线在此完成闭环。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"例外处理质量看板","id":"例外处理质量看板"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：看板的三层结构","id":"核心概念-看板的三层结构"},{"level":2,"text":"指标定义的一致性与口径锁定","id":"指标定义的一致性与口径锁定"},{"level":3,"text":"同一个指标在不同系统里必须同义","id":"同一个指标在不同系统里必须同义"},{"level":2,"text":"例外漏斗与瓶颈定位","id":"例外漏斗与瓶颈定位"},{"level":3,"text":"漏斗的每一段都要有转化率","id":"漏斗的每一段都要有转化率"},{"level":3,"text":"在办量与到达率的动态平衡","id":"在办量与到达率的动态平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"看板的可审计性与口径争议的解决","id":"看板的可审计性与口径争议的解决"},{"level":3,"text":"每个数字可下钻到明细","id":"每个数字可下钻到明细"},{"level":3,"text":"跨系统对账式的自检","id":"跨系统对账式的自检"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高发渠道治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/exception-governance/high-risk-channel-govern"},"next":null}